WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.119
"Ugh!" Ben groaned as he bumped into the wall, right behind Winnie.

2
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.119
"I think there's a boiler room on the other side of this wall."

3
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:20.898
"Maybe we can cut through the gym," Gaby said. "Come on!"

4
00:00:20.899 --> 00:00:26.960
The five friends dodged through the gym equipment and reached the far door.

5
00:00:26.961 --> 00:00:31.204
In the hallway, they started following the compass again.

6
00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:35.138
At last they came to a glass door.

7
00:00:35.139 --> 00:00:38.010
"The greenhouse!" Gaby said.

8
00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:41.716
"I hope the treasure is buried here," Waldo said.

9
00:00:41.717 --> 00:00:47.102
"The floor of the greenhouse is dirt—it should be easy to dig."

10
00:00:47.103 --> 00:00:55.013
They went inside and Winnie ran along, following the compass.

11
00:00:55.014 --> 00:01:01.782
"It's buried right here!" she cried, tracing a big X on the ground.

12
00:01:01.783 --> 00:01:08.557
" X marks the spot!" Mog grinned and started

13
00:01:08.558 --> 00:01:19.169
digging. They found some more shovels in the greenhouse, and soon everyone was digging—and

14
00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:24.746
sweating. They dug for

15
00:01:24.747 --> 00:01:31.100
hours. Finally Gaby stopped to rest. "It's hot in here," she

16
00:01:31.101 --> 00:01:36.747
said. "And we're making such slow progress. We don't have much time

17
00:01:36.748 --> 00:01:42.924
left." "I need a snack," Mog complained. "And some

18
00:01:42.925 --> 00:01:45.825
sleep." "Hey!" Waldo snapped his

19
00:01:45.826 --> 00:01:48.663
fingers. "I'll use magic to make the shovels dig on their

20
00:01:48.664 --> 00:01:54.651
own!" He started to cast a spell. "Shovels strong and shovels

21
00:01:54.652 --> 00:01:57.347
true—" "Waldo—" Winnie

22
00:01:57.348 --> 00:02:02.010
warned. "Do the digging for me and—ah-ah-ah . . .

23
00:02:02.011 --> 00:02:04.526
!" "Uh-oh," Mog

24
00:02:04.527 --> 00:02:11.710
murmured. "Choo!" Waldo sneezed, and all the shovels turned into

25
00:02:11.711 --> 00:02:17.182
worms. The worms wriggled away before Winnie could try to turn them back into

26
00:02:17.183 --> 00:02:22.470
shovels. "Ack!" Mog cried. "Now what are we going to

27
00:02:22.471 --> 00:02:28.953
do?" The kids slumped to the ground, dirty and

28
00:02:28.954 --> 00:02:34.526
exhausted. Nobody said anything until Ben got to his

29
00:02:34.527 --> 00:02:40.332
feet. "I'll look around," he said. "Maybe there are some other tools we can use for

30
00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:46.251
digging." Rumble! Just then Ben heard something outside. "Oh no!" he

31
00:02:46.252 --> 00:02:54.855
cried. "The wrecking crew!" Soon bulldozers, wrecking balls, and steam shovels would be destroying their

32
00:02:54.856 --> 00:03:02.552
school! "Steam shovels!" Ben blurted out. "Winnie, can you make a magical steam shovel to dig

33
00:03:02.553 --> 00:03:06.375
faster?" "I don't know anything about steam shovels!" Winnie

34
00:03:06.376 --> 00:03:10.256
cried. "I'm still learning magic, and I don't have a spell

35
00:03:10.257 --> 00:03:13.456
book." Waldo jumped to his feet. "I can

36
00:03:13.457 --> 00:03:16.968
try—" "No!" everyone

37
00:03:16.969 --> 00:03:20.767
shouted. "I wasn't going to try magic." Waldo looked

38
00:03:20.768 --> 00:03:23.972
offended. "I just wanted to explain how steam shovels

39
00:03:23.973 --> 00:03:27.274
work." "Tell me!" Winnie

40
00:03:27.275 --> 00:03:38.499
cried. Waldo quickly described how steam shovels work, sketching diagrams in the

41
00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.216
dirt. Then Winnie closed her eyes.

42
00:03:41.217 --> 00:03:50.026
"Shovel, shovel, soil and rubble . . . Help us dig out of this trouble!"

43
00:03:50.027 --> 00:03:55.367
Zap! A steam shovel appeared and went instantly to work.

44
00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:59.708
Dirt flew all over the greenhouse.

45
00:03:59.709 --> 00:04:03.714
Clunk! At last the steam shovel hit something.

46
00:04:03.715 --> 00:04:06.410
"The treasure chest!" Mog cried.

47
00:04:06.411 --> 00:04:08.350
Ben glanced out the window.

48
00:04:08.351 --> 00:04:12.077
Bulldozers had nearly reached the school's driveway.

49
00:04:12.078 --> 00:04:14.781
"Quick! Let's lift it out of the ground!"

50
00:04:14.782 --> 00:04:18.377
The steam shovel lifted the chest out of the ground.

51
00:04:18.378 --> 00:04:23.795
"Open the doors," Winnie said. "Let's get the chest outside!"

52
00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:29.975
Waldo threw open the greenhouse doors, and they hauled the heavy chest out onto the lawn.

53
00:04:29.976 --> 00:04:34.604
Mayor Hubbletree and Mr. Freaky were standing near the school's main entrance.

54
00:04:34.605 --> 00:04:40.132
And Ben spotted someone else. Pedro!

55
00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:43.953
He was racing toward the bulldozer with two other pirates.

56
00:04:43.954 --> 00:04:47.145
The old skeletons waved their swords.

57
00:04:47.146 --> 00:04:49.228
"Stop!" Pedro yelled.

58
00:04:49.229 --> 00:04:53.471
"You'll have to go through us to knock down Monster Academy!"

59
00:04:53.472 --> 00:04:57.496
The three pirates leaped in front of the bulldozers.

60
00:04:57.497 --> 00:05:01.953
"Pedro, get out of the way," Mayor Hubbletree commanded.

61
00:05:01.954 --> 00:05:05.122
Pedro stood fiercely with his crew.

62
00:05:05.123 --> 00:05:09.174
"Wait!" Mog waved his arms madly.

63
00:05:09.175 --> 00:05:13.158
"Pedro! Mr. Freaky! We found the treasure!"

64
00:05:13.159 --> 00:05:16.929
"You don't have to knock down the school!" Ben yelled.

65
00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:23.290
Pedro looked over and saw the chest. "Whew!" he said.

66
00:05:23.291 --> 00:05:29.933
"To tell you the truth, I wasn't sure we could stop these bulldozers."

67
00:05:29.934 --> 00:05:32.852
The mayor rushed over.

68
00:05:32.853 --> 00:05:35.663
"Open that chest!"

69
00:05:35.664 --> 00:05:38.943
Pedro broke the rusty old lock with his sword.

70
00:05:38.944 --> 00:05:41.435
He threw open the lid.

71
00:05:41.436 --> 00:05:46.386
The mayor bent forward. "What's this?" he bellowed.

72
00:05:46.387 --> 00:05:55.075
Ben floated closer. Inside the chest lay not gold but . . . "Huh? Musical instruments?"

73
00:05:55.076 --> 00:06:01.081
Pedro grinned. "We were the best pirate band on the seas!"

74
00:06:01.082 --> 00:06:05.179
He reached for a xylophone with his bony fingers.

75
00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:08.364
Mr. Freaky collapsed onto the ground.

76
00:06:08.365 --> 00:06:15.215
"Monster Academy is doomed! Music won't save the school."

77
00:06:15.216 --> 00:06:17.841
"Of course it will!" Pedro said.

78
00:06:17.842 --> 00:06:24.529
"I could find only our drummer and banjo player, but we can still put on a concert."

79
00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:29.011
"Pedro and the Pirates will fill Monster Stadium!" Waldo said.

80
00:06:29.012 --> 00:06:34.852
"They'll definitely raise enough money to repair our school."

81
00:06:34.853 --> 00:06:37.973
Mr. Freaky slowly climbed to his feet.

82
00:06:37.974 --> 00:06:40.093
"I told you students not to worry.

83
00:06:40.094 --> 00:06:45.814
Everything at Monster Academy is totally under control!"

84
00:06:45.815 --> 00:06:49.327
Ben turned to Mog, who was holding a banjo.

85
00:06:49.328 --> 00:06:52.274
"Still want to be a pirate when you grow up?"

86
00:06:52.275 --> 00:06:56.840
"Nah." Mog shook his head and strummed the banjo.

87
00:06:56.848 --> 00:07:09.003
"Maybe I'll join a band instead!"

